Feature:

Background: This executes once per feature file
	Given these properties
		|portal.release|true|
		|portal.upstream|true|
		|custom.properties|default.layout.template.id=1_column|
		|testray.main.component.name|Message Boards|
	And these variables
		|portal.release|true|
		|portal.upstream|true|
		|custom.properties|default.layout.template.id=1_column|
		|testray.main.component.name|Message Boards|
		|pageName|Message Boards Page|
		|portletName|Message Boards|
Setup: This executes before each scenario 
	Given TestCase set Up Portal Instance
	When User first Login PG
Teardown: This executes after each scenario 
	Given PortalInstances tear Down CP
		|testPortalInstance|TestPropsUtil#get('test.portal.instance')|
Scenario: Copy And Paste Text In Alloy Editor
Priority: 4
	Given Page add
		|pageName|Message Boards Page|
	When SitePageNavigator goto Edit Page
		|page|Message Boards Page|
	And Page edit Page Layout Column
		|columnName|1 Column|
	And Navigator goto Page
		|pageName|Message Boards Page|
	And Portlet add PG
		|portletName|Message Boards|
	And Navigator goto Page
		|pageName|Message Boards Page|
	And AssertClick the value 'Post New Thread' at locator 'Button#POST_NEW_THREAD'
	And AssertElementPresent at locator 'TextInput#SUBJECT'
	And Type the value 'Message Boards Subject' at locator 'TextInput#SUBJECT'
	And Type type Editor the value 'Message Boards Body' at locator 'AlloyEditor#CONTENT_FIELD'
	And Copy at locator 'TextInput#SUBJECT'
	And Paste at locator 'AlloyEditor#CONTENT_FIELD'
	And PortletEntry publish
	And Navigator goto Page
		|pageName|Message Boards Page|
	And MessageboardsThread goto PG
		|lastPostUserName|Test Test|
		|postCount|1|
		|threadBody|Message Boards Subject|
		|threadSubject|Message Boards Subject|
	Then MessageboardsThread view PG
		|threadBody|Message Boards Subject|
		|threadSubject|Message Boards Subject|
		|userName|Test Test|
